The SYNTHETIC datasets in this directory are made available under the Open Database License
(ODbL) v1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

They are a derivative database of the MIMIC-IV Clinical Database Demo v2.2
(https://physionet.org/content/mimic-iv-demo/2.2/, ODbL v1.0, Johnson et al.), whose subject and
admission identifiers and times they reuse. All other content is synthetic, generated by
scripts/synthetic_demo.py; it is not patient data and must not be used for research.

The generator code is covered by the repository's MIT license (../../LICENSE).
